"vo_end": 9.04,
"text": "The scene brings a crew together. In Perth, Australia, a 14-year-old called Dylan Wheeler, already suspended for hacking his school, twice.",
"end": 9.315
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 9.315,
"vo_start": 9.59,
"vo_end": 16.39,
"text": "In New Jersey, Sanadodeh Nesheiwat, 24, who takes consoles apart with a soldering iron. Online: Sonic.",
"end": 16.665
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 16.665,
"vo_start": 16.94,
"vo_end": 23.46,
"text": "And in Delaware, Justin May, a few years older than David, who buys a dev kit from him. Online: MTW.",
"end": 23.735
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 23.735,
"vo_start": 24.01,
"vo_end": 31.85,
"text": "Later they're joined by two more: Austin Alcala, 16, from Indiana, and Nathan Leroux, 18, from Maryland, who dreams of making games.",
"end": 32.8
}
],
